      "Space is not only about prestige. It builds a knowledge economy: engineers, scientists, data specialists and entrepreneurs. Satellite data supports climate monitoring, agriculture, urban planning and security. In May 2026, a plan of roughly AED 1 billion to strengthen the space sector was announced, signalling that the ambition continues to deepen.",
      "Hope is the UAE&#39;s Mars orbiter. It entered Mars orbit in February 2021 and studies the planet&#39;s atmosphere and weather.",
      "It reached the Moon in 2023 but was lost when the lander carrying it crashed. A second rover, Rashid 2, has been built for a future mission.",
